    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4a Welcome to Orange Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn into the world as... well, an orange. No explanation, no backstory \u2014 just you, your bouncy peel, and a strange ramp calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb it, and whatever you do \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t stop at the top</strong>. A super sprint will launch you forward at insane speed. The laws of physics? Optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have a special ability: the <strong>Mega Jump</strong>. Press <strong>SPACEBAR</strong> to jump... and keep pressing. Each jump boosts your strength, letting you leap higher and higher like a juicy superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your first mission and earn the ultimate reward: <strong>a car</strong>.<br>It\u2019s got first-person and third-person modes, a fuel system (don\u2019t run out!), and full orange-powered movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and since you gathered all those oranges... you can now <strong>throw infinite oranges</strong>. For fun. Or chaos. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude82 Jump like a maniac.<br>\ud83d\udca6 Avoid water (you can\u2019t swim \u2014 you\u2019re an orange, remember?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deep narrative. No complex systems. Just pure, ridiculous fun in a surreal open world.<br>Welcome to <strong>Orange Life</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf4a Welcome to Orange Life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You spawn into the world as... well, an orange. No explanation, no backstory \u2014 just you, your bouncy peel, and a strange ramp calling your name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb it, and whatever you do \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t stop at the top</strong>. A super sprint will launch you forward at insane speed. The laws of physics? Optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also have a special ability: the <strong>Mega Jump</strong>. Press <strong>SPACEBAR</strong> to jump... and keep pressing. Each jump boosts your strength, letting you leap higher and higher like a juicy superhero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your first mission and earn the ultimate reward: <strong>a car</strong>.<br>It\u2019s got first-person and third-person modes, a fuel system (don\u2019t run out!), and full orange-powered movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and since you gathered all those oranges... you can now <strong>throw infinite oranges</strong>. For fun. Or chaos. Your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude82 Jump like a maniac.<br>\ud83d\udca6 Avoid water (you can\u2019t swim \u2014 you\u2019re an orange, remember?).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No deep narrative. No complex systems. Just pure, ridiculous fun in a surreal open world.<br>Welcome to <strong>Orange Life</strong></p>",
